      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Second"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手前の 6 つの穴があなた、奥の 6 つが CPU。右端の大きなくぼみがあなたのストア、左端が CPU のストアです。はじめは各穴に 4 個ずつ、合わせて 48 個の種があります。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The 6 pits nearest you are yours and the far 6 are the CPU's. The large hollow on the right is your store; the one on the left is the CPU's. Each pit starts with 4 seeds, 48 in all."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手前の穴をタップして種をまこう" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Tap one of your pits to sow its seeds"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "手番" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Turn order"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "新規対局しますか？" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Start a new game?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最後の 1 個が自分のストアに入ったら、もう一度続けてまけます。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If your last seed lands in your own store, you sow again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "最後の 1 個が自分の側の空の穴に入り、向かいの相手の穴に種があれば、その種と最後の 1 個をまとめて自分のストアに入れます。向かいが空なら取れません。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If your last seed lands in an empty pit on your side and the opposite pit has seeds, you put those seeds and your last seed into your store. Nothing is captured if the opposite pit is empty."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "盤" : {
